OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ASchools not ready for AI and 'crying
OL,4,Aout' for government guidance, report
OL,5,Awarns
OL,6,
OL,7,FHis report calls for the government to
OL,8,Froll out a national framework for
OL,9,Fadopting AI in education in England,
OL,10,Fincluding training teachers on how to
OL,11,Fuse it, which schools should use to
OL,12,Fdevelop their own "AI strategies" by
OL,13,FSeptember next year.
OL,15,FThe government says its changes to the
OL,16,Fcurriculum in England will give
OL,17,Fchildren digital skills and help them
OL,18,Fspot disinformation.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
